#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"When creating a filled signal set, the glibc B<sigfillset>()  function does "
"not include the two real-time signals used internally by the NPTL threading "
"implementation.  See B<nptl>(7)  for details."
msgstr ""
"Lors de la création d'un ensemble de signaux remplis, la fonction "
"B<sigfillset>() de la glibc n'inclut pas deux signaux en temps réel utilisés "
"en interne par l'implémentation de threading de NPTL."

